      "alt": "Starterkit STKa53",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A8 based on i.MX53</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa53 is an evaluation kit designed for embedded computing engineers. It is based on the TQMa53 platform, featuring the Arm Cortex-A8 processor from NXP's i.MX53 series. This evaluation kit is known for its ability to lead out all functional CPU pins on module connectors, making it suitable for a range of applications. It offers support for IEEE 1588, low power consumption (typically around 3 watts), security functions, and features e-MMC Flash storage. The integrated graphic controller supports high-resolution displays, making it an ideal choice for human-machine interfaces (HMI), animated screens, and multitouch applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:27:33 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
